"`uri?` → `[{ uri, diagnostics: [{ message, severity, range, source }] }]`"
msgstr ""
"`uri?` → `[{ uri, diagnostics: [{ message, severity, range, source }] }]`"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:270
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`filePath` → `{ isDirty, isUntitled }`, or `{ success: false }` if the "
"document is not open"
msgstr ""
"`filePath` → `{ isDirty, isUntitled }`。ドキュメントが開いていなければ `{ success: false }`"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:271
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`filePath` → `{ saved }`, or `{ success: false }` if the document is not "
"open"
msgstr "`filePath` → `{ saved }`。ドキュメントが開いていなければ `{ success: false }`"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:272
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`oldFilePath`, `newFilePath`, `newFileContents`, `tabName`, `diffId` → `{ "
"accepted: true, contents }` or `{ accepted: false }`, answered when the user"
" decides"
msgstr ""
"`oldFilePath`、`newFilePath`、`newFileContents`、`tabName`、`diffId` → `{ "
"accepted: true, contents }` か `{ accepted: false }`。ユーザーが決めたときに答える"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:273
msgid "`tabName`, and `diffId` if only that diff is to be closed → anything"
msgstr "`tabName`。そのタブのうち、その差分だけを閉じたいときは `diffId` も → 何でもよい"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:274
#, python-brace-format
msgid "→ `{ closed: n }`"
msgstr "→ `{ closed: n }`"

#: ../../DESIGN.md:274
